      decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.apply", decl_name: "apply_wet"),
    ],
  },
  question: "Which authority realizes runner slot adds: runner_capacity_realize's apply path or runner_host_file_converge_ci_wet? Only the latter has an executing route in CI (fleet-converge.yml); gunbc.apply::apply_wet is never invoked by any workflow.",
  sightings: FreeSemigroup {
    head: ConcernSighting {
      revision: "855daebfec53",
      evidence: FreeSemigroup {
        head: CitesDeclaration { declaration: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.runner.runner_capacity_realize", decl_name: "runner_capacity_apply_wet_exit") },
        tail: [CitesDeclaration { declaration: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.runner.runner_host_file_converge", decl_name: "runner_host_file_converge_ci_wet") }],
      },
      account: "git grep origin/main finds no workflow that runs gunbc.apply apply_wet. fleet-converge.yml invokes fleet_converge_apply_wet, gcp_iam_*_apply_wet and branch_run_grant_apply_wet, never gunbc.apply. So runner_capacity_realize's apply has no executing route, while runner_host_file_converge_ci_wet is the route that actually converges slots. Two places answer 'realize runner slot adds' and only one runs.",
    },
    tail: [],
  },
  disposition: Triaged {
    home: ExistingHome { model: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.runner.runner_host_file_converge", decl_name: "runner_host_file_converge_ci_wet") },
    preserve: [
      PreservedObligation {
        holder: decl_ref(module_path: "gunbc.runner.runner_capacity_realize", decl_name: "runner_capacity_apply_wet_exit"),
        control: decl_ref(module_path: "test.claim.runner.runner_capacity_realize_witness", decl_name: "converged_roster_plans_zero_additions_and_apply_succeeds"),
        statement: "the capacity realize seam plans and preflights per-host additions, producing typed receipts; whether it executes or defers to the converge path is B3b's decision",
